From dc1306b18eb94909d2c781553d41418698261f8f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Josua Mayer <josua@solid-run.com>
Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 18:17:01 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] lx2160acex7: clearfog-cx: drop implicit dpl properties

Reduce DPL size by removing properties which the management complex
applies implicitly:

- compatible strings of objects, these are identified by node name
- dpni defaults: num_tcs = 1, fs_entries = 64, qos_entries = 0,
  vlan_filter_entries = 0, num_cgs = 1, num_channels = 1, num_opr = 0

This reduces the compiled dpl from 18187 to 11123 bytes (s1_8),
and from 19399 to 11951 bytes (s1_20).

Signed-off-by: Josua Mayer <josua@solid-run.com>
---
 .../clearfog-cx-s1_20-s2_0-dpl.dts            | 321 ------------------
 .../clearfog-cx-s1_8-s2_0-dpl.dts             | 312 -----------------
 2 files changed, 633 deletions(-)

